{
  "//": [
    "Q07 — 90-day spending leaderboard",
    "What it answers: \"Who were the top 20 spenders in the last 90 days, and what rank is each?\"",
    "Route:           GET /stats/leaderboard   (params: start, end; every route also takes db=)",
    "Pattern:         window_ranking",
    "Engine:          MongoDB",
    "Think about it:",
    "Find PROJECTION_COVERED in the idx_* plan and the number of documents",
    "examined. What does 'covered' mean here? Then why is the index only about 3x",
    "faster than noidx, not 100x?"
  ],
  "aggregate": "purchases",
  "cursor": {},
  "pipeline": [
    {
      "$match": {
        "purchase_date": {
          "$gte": "{{start:date}}",
          "$lt": "{{end:date}}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "$group": {
        "_id": "$customer_id",
        "total": {
          "$sum": "$amount"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "$setWindowFields": {
        "sortBy": {
          "total": -1
        },
        "output": {
          "rank": {
            "$rank": {}
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "$sort": {
        "total": -1,
        "_id": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "$limit": 20
    },
    {
      "$project": {
        "_id": 0,
        "customer_id": "$_id",
        "total": {
          "$round": [
            "$total",
            2
          ]
        },
        "rank": 1
      }
    }
  ]
}
